      "content": "but i dont think i'm becoming anything. that's the thing. everything i was, everything i cared about... it was all tied to him. now that he's gone, there's just this hollow shell left. it's like i'm already dead, i'm just still walking around. it feels more like an accident that i'm still here than an actual life.",
