      "content": "but there’s nothing left to paint with. i try to imagine a \"new\" version of me, but i just feel like a ghost. it’s exhausting, honestly. just trying to maintain this... appearance of being a person. sometimes i think it would just be more peaceful to stop trying so hard to exist when there's nothing actually there.",
